==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[foreswear]]

===Etymology===
{{etyl|enm}} {{term|forsweren||lang=enm}}, from {{etyl|ang}} {{term|forswerian||to swear falsely|lang=ang}}. More at {{prefix|for|swear}}.

===Pronunciation===
*: {{rhymes|ɛə(r)}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb|forswears|forswearing|forswore|forsworn}}

# {{transitive}} To [[renounce]] or [[deny]] [[something]], especially under [[oath]].
# {{intransitive}} To [[commit]] [[perjury]].

